    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "small steps? i think i missed the window for that. i wasn't a person who just \"reconnected\" with things. i was someone who lived at 100% all the time. now i'm just watching my life happen from the sidelines. it feels like the version of me that mattered is already dead, you know? like i'm just a ghost haunting my own body.",
